WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.296
打开 Composer / Open Composer

2
00:00:03.296 --> 00:00:06.206
新建响应检查请求 / Create the response inspection request

3
00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:09.096
填写响应检查地址 / Enter the response inspection URL

4
00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:11.946
填写 x-guide-request / Enter x-guide-request

5
00:00:11.946 --> 00:00:14.812
填写 inspection-demo / Enter inspection-demo

6
00:00:14.812 --> 00:00:17.696
添加请求 Header / Add the request Header

7
00:00:17.696 --> 00:00:20.845
Send 并接收真实 JSON / Send and receive real JSON

8
00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:23.845
打开响应 Headers / Open response Headers

9
00:00:23.845 --> 00:00:26.745
折叠 Response Headers / Collapse Response Headers

10
00:00:26.745 --> 00:00:29.645
折叠 Request Headers / Collapse Request Headers

11
00:00:29.645 --> 00:00:32.546
展开 Response Headers / Expand Response Headers

12
00:00:32.546 --> 00:00:35.453
展开 Request Headers / Expand Request Headers

13
00:00:35.453 --> 00:00:38.357
打开响应 Cookies / Open response Cookies

14
00:00:38.357 --> 00:00:41.250
折叠 Cookies 分组 / Collapse the Cookies section

15
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:44.157
展开 Cookies 分组 / Expand the Cookies section

16
00:00:44.157 --> 00:00:47.100
查看 Timing 与连接信息 / Inspect Timing and connection details

17
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:50.004
折叠 Timing 分组 / Collapse Timing

18
00:00:50.004 --> 00:00:52.895
折叠 Connection 分组 / Collapse Connection

19
00:00:52.895 --> 00:00:55.795
展开 Timing 分组 / Expand Timing

20
00:00:55.795 --> 00:00:58.695
展开 Connection 分组 / Expand Connection

21
00:00:58.695 --> 00:01:01.595
返回响应 Body / Return to response Body

22
00:01:01.595 --> 00:01:04.497
切换 Tree / Switch to Tree

23
00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:07.350
折叠 JSON 根节点 / Collapse the JSON root

24
00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:10.198
展开 JSON 根节点 / Expand the JSON root

25
00:01:10.198 --> 00:01:13.096
打开 message 的右键菜单 / Open the message context menu

26
00:01:13.096 --> 00:01:15.995
复制 message 的值 / Copy the message value

27
00:01:15.995 --> 00:01:18.907
切换 Raw / Switch to Raw

28
00:01:18.907 --> 00:01:21.804
复制 Raw 原始文本 / Copy the Raw response text

29
00:01:21.804 --> 00:01:24.698
切换 Hex 字节视图 / Switch to Hex bytes

30
00:01:24.698 --> 00:01:27.595
复制 Hex 并核对原始字节 / Copy Hex and verify the original bytes

31
00:01:27.595 --> 00:01:30.546
全屏查看响应 Hex / Open the response Hex fullscreen

32
00:01:30.546 --> 00:01:33.447
退出正文全屏 / Exit body fullscreen

33
00:01:33.447 --> 00:01:36.847
拖宽 Collection 分栏 / Widen the Collection pane

34
00:01:36.847 --> 00:01:40.248
向上拖动以增高响应区 / Drag upward to enlarge the response pane

35
00:01:40.248 --> 00:01:43.096
填写独立 CSS 地址 / Enter the separate CSS URL

36
00:01:43.096 --> 00:01:46.097
接收需要手动 Format 的 CSS / Receive CSS requiring manual Format

37
00:01:46.097 --> 00:01:49.146
复制并核对 Format 前的 CSS / Copy and verify CSS before Format

38
00:01:49.146 --> 00:01:52.397
点击 Format 格式化响应 / Click Format on the response

39
00:01:52.397 --> 00:01:55.308
复制并核对格式化结果 / Copy and verify the formatted result
